{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:42:33+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:42:33+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Quilter plc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://plc.quilter.com","employees":3207,"summary":"Quilter plc provides advice-led investment solutions in the United Kingdom and internationally. It operates through High Net Worth and Affluent segments. The High Net Worth segment provides discretionary investment management services to high-net worth clients, charities, companies, and institutions through a network of branches; and financial advice services for protection, mortgages, savings, investment, and pensions primarily to high-net-worth clients. Its Affluent segment comprises Quilter Investment Platform, an investment platform for advice-based wealth management products and services; Quilter Investor, which offers investment solutions in the form of funds for the group and third-party clients; and Quilter Financial planning, a restricted and independent financial adviser network that provides mortgage and financial planning advice, and solution for individuals and business through a network of intermediaries. The company was incorporated in 2007 and is based in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Quilter plc fournit des solutions d'investissement basées sur le conseil au Royaume-Uni et à l'international. Il opère à travers des segments à valeur nette élevée et Affluent. Le segment des valeurs nettes élevées fournit des services discrétionnaires de gestion de placements aux clients fortunés, aux organismes de bienfaisance, aux entreprises et aux institutions par l'intermédiaire d'un réseau de succursales; et des services de conseils financiers pour la protection, les prêts hypothécaires, l'